        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jaap J. Vermeulen\n- Plants: tropical genus of flowering plant, Bismarckia\n- Animals: Rhynchophorus cruentatus, palmetto weevil\n- Topics: species comparison, susceptibility\n\nFacts:\n- Jaap J. Vermeulen specializes in a tropical genus of flowering plant.\n- The tropical genus of flowering plant has more species than Bismarckia.\n- Bismarckia is susceptible to Rhynchophorus cruentatus.\n- Rhynchophorus cruentatus is also called the palmetto weevil.",
